pan _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" style="color: #055274;">هزينه‏ هاى فروش، ادارى و عمومى </span></td><td _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" style="color: #055274;" class="is-negative">(۴۶۷,۲۴۸) </span></td><td _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" style="color: #055274;" class="is-negative">(۳۰۵,۴۴۸) </span></td><td _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" style="color: #055274;" class="is-negative">(۵۳) </span></td></tr><tr _ngcontent-fhn-c3=""><!----><td _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class="right-aligne"><span _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" style="color: #055274;">هزينه کاهش ارزش دريافتني‏ ها (هزينه استثنايي) </span></td><td _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" style="color: #055274;">۰ </span></td><td _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" style="color: #055274;">۰ </span></td><td _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" style="color: #055274;"> </span></td></tr><tr _ngcontent-fhn-c3=""><!----><td _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class="right-aligne"><span _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" style="color: #055274;">ساير درآمدها </span></td><td _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" style="color: #055274;">۲۲,۸۲۹ </span></td><td _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" style="color: #055274;">۳۵,۵۳۷ </span></td><td _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" style="color: #055274;" class="is-negative">(۳۶) </span></td></tr><tr _ngcontent-fhn-c3=""><!----><td _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class="right-aligne"><span _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" style="color: #055274;">ساير هزينه‌ها </span></td><td _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-fhn-c3="" style="color: #055274;